@@ -15,3 +15,10 @@ language.

 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
 `src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+
+## Sites
+
+Requests select a site with the `X-Larder-Site` header (default `main`). An
+unknown site returns HTTP 400 with code `unknown_site`. Batches, stock on
+hand, cooking, alerts, the stock value report and stock-takes only see the
+request's site; items, suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared.
