   of them needs at least one reading per day.
 - Allergens are the 14 EU allergens, stored lowercase and sorted.
+
+## Sites (schema 3)
+
+- The store has a `sites` list (`{ id, name }`), and every location has a
+  `site` id referencing one of them. Older files migrate by creating site
+  `main` ("Main kitchen") and assigning all existing locations to it.
+- Batches, stock on hand, cooking, alerts, stock value reports and
+  stock-takes are scoped to the request's site (determined through each
+  location's `site`). Items, suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared across
+  sites.
